  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "雲端數位創新科技",
    "sub_ename": "CLOUD TECHNOLOGY AND DIGITAL INNOVATION",
    "describe_ch": "數位經濟以數位科技為要素實行創新經濟活動，雲端科技、AI及IoT正在顛覆事業經營的模式，社會事業與合作經濟的發展，須結合雲端科技與資通訊技術，以創新思維進行跨域整合，課程將整合理論與實務，拓展學生綜合學能。",
    "describe_eh": "The digital economy uses digital technology as the primary element to implement innovative economic activities. Cloud technology, AI and IoT are disrupting business models. The development of cooperative economics and social entrepreneurship has to utilize cloud technology and ICT for cross-domain integration based on creative thinking. The course will integrate theory and practice to expand students’ comprehensive academic ability.",
